阮徛佇岸邊 等你的船
風吹冷冷 心肝燒燒

[Chorus]
燈若熄 船就到
阮的心 替你留一葩
燈若熄 船就到
阮佇遮 等你轉來
```

### 風格

```
1980s Taiwanese Hokkien ballad, mature male vocal, accordion and electric organ, slow waltz, nostalgic harbour song, AM radio lo-fi, mono, vinyl crackle
```

